# hero-click-fit-1024x640 (h11-hero): a click on the hero under the fit.
# The click is at the hero's DESIGN centre: page.json's welcome-fit-1024x640
# hero_plane box (369.999, 135.399, 596.400, 369.200 CSS px) is the screen
# box of the shrunk page, so its centre (668, 320) is where the design box's
# centre lands on screen. The port's hit test divides the pointer by the fit
# (0.71) before it tests the region, so (668, 320) resolves to the design
# centre (941, 450): the state exercises the fit inverse, not the rendered
# screen centre (which the review found the port draws larger than the
# reference's at this size — fix-viewer-size's finding). The click lands
# inside the region on both sides and navigates to #function-viewer with an
# empty query, as the click at fit 1 does.
route welcome
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
click 668 320
wait 2000
move 511 34
wait 300
shot hero-click-fit-1024x640
